{"id":"fcbf14393ebfa830","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-fourier-transform.md","title":"Fourier Transform of Boolean Functions","display":"df-fourier-transform — Fourier Transform of Boolean Functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-fourier-transform — Fourier Transform of Boolean Functions","label":"28-df-fourier-transform","aliases":["28-df-fourier-transform"],"type":"definition","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §22.5.1","source_printed_pages":"475–476","source_pdf_pages":"501–502","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fourier-transform — Fourier Transform of Boolean Functions"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-fourier-transform"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-fourier-transform</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §22.5.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"475–476"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"501–502"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f,g:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n\">\\(x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n\\)</span>；空乘积为一。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_S(x)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i,\\qquad\\chi_\\varnothing(x)\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_S(x)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i,\\qquad\\chi_\\varnothing(x)\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle f,g\\rangle_n\\coloneqq2^{-n}\\sum_{x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n}f(x)g(x),\\qquad \\widehat f(S)\\coloneqq\\langle f,\\chi_S\\rangle_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle f,g\\rangle_n\\coloneqq2^{-n}\\sum_{x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n}f(x)g(x),\\qquad \\widehat f(S)\\coloneqq\\langle f,\\chi_S\\rangle_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>采用均匀测度归一化的 Walsh 字符；这是布尔立方体傅里叶系数，与量子模 M 变换的归一化和论域不同。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§22.5.1，印刷页 475–476；PDF 页 501–502。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f,g:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_S(x)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i,\\qquad\\chi_\\varnothing(x)\\coloneqq1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle f,g\\rangle_n\\coloneqq2^{-n}\\sum_{x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n}f(x)g(x),\\qquad \\widehat f(S)\\coloneqq\\langle f,\\chi_S\\rangle_n.","display":true}],"bytes":1244,"backlinks":[{"id":"fbf7ed6af95f19de","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\widehat f$ 与均匀内积见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]；下式定义坐标影响、总影响和离散导数。"},{"id":"6c37c07068c18aeb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}$，假定 $\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)$，其定义见 [[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]；$\\widehat f(S)$、$\\chi_S$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]，$S\\subseteq[W]$。"},{"id":"53ae7f63203f2960","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f,\\rho,W,\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho$ 采用 [[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]；$\\widehat f(S),\\chi_S$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]；$S\\subseteq[W]$。有限整数幂采用空积约定 $a^0=1$（包括 $a=0$）。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"布尔函数分析：[[28-df-fourier-transform]]。"},{"id":"da1164816c0805f0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\{-1,1\\}$，$0<\\epsilon\\le1/2$；$x,y$ 为独立均匀符号向量，$xy$ 为逐坐标乘积。$\\chi_S,\\widehat f(S)$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]。"},{"id":"930d23349770c79c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f,g:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R$；$\\chi_S,\\widehat f(S),\\langle f,g\\rangle_n$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}